<!--
  Weapons for Infall: Deck Collapse. Each weapon is its own entry, written the way the Infall docs and Ship Design's
  ship files write them (deck-collapse-ships README, gap G4). A weapon system holds up to 4 weapons; its level is the
  power its weapons may use each turn.

  <family>   what a kind of weapon does with shields and crew. kind="laser" on a weapon picks its family.
    shields       pop     each shield layer stops one shot and drops
                  reduce  damage is lowered by the number of layers; layers stay up (beams)
                  ignore  passes through shields
    usesMissile / woundsCrew / neverMisses / ion   as named
    base          Mawjig per shot at 1 damage (mawjig-cost-table.md); beams per system swept

  <weapon>   one weapon. Missing numbers default to 1.
    kind          its family
    power         the card's power cost
    shots         shots per card
    damage        damage per shot (0 for ion, spores, mind control)
    speed         how many cards it adds to the deck (1 slow … 5 fast). Default: 36 ÷ its cooldown from
                  weapon-budget-table.md, rounded. Once a weapon is made, its speed is fixed.
    rooms         beams: systems swept in a row
    fire, breach  percent chance per hit
    pierce        shield layers it passes
    multiTarget   true: with Multi Target Lasers On, each shot can aim at its own system (docs/ideas.md)
    chain         true: firing adds a temporary copy of the card to the deck (up to 3)
    defensive     true: once per enemy turn, while its system works, shoots down an incoming torpedo
    spores        true: a hit system is overgrown, offline until a Repair clears it (GDD 8G; G5)
    stun          true: crew in the hit system lose their next turn
    mind          true: a hit takes over one crew member in the system for a turn
    tech          its maker's tech (kept for later; GDD 8D)
    bands         the difficulty bands it can turn up in (stores, enemies), e.g. "2-8". New ideas such as multi-target
                  lasers start later so concepts come in slowly (heromedel 2026-10-29). Default 1-8. The band
                  numbers here are Ai-Generated-Proposal.
  Price and Mawjig per card come from weapon-budget-table.md and mawjig-cost-table.md (see Weapons.price, .ammo).

  Sources: genre-style weapons follow the genre's numbers, renamed. Infall weapons are from Ship Design's ship files
  (Cloud-C-ShipDesign, docs/deck-collapse-ships) and the cost tables' worked examples. Weapons marked
  Ai-Generated-Proposal are new.
-->
<weapons>
  <family id="laser" name="Laser" shields="pop" base="0.02">Fast bolts. Each shield layer stops one.</family>
  <family id="flak" name="Flak" shields="pop" base="0.01">A spread of debris. Each piece can stop on a shield layer.</family>
  <family id="ion" name="Ion" shields="pop" ion="true" base="0.02">A hit system goes offline for a turn; a hit reactor loses a Power Cell.</family>
  <family id="missile" name="Missile" shields="ignore" usesMissile="true" woundsCrew="true" base="0.05">Ignores shields. The blast wounds crew in the system.</family>
  <family id="beam" name="Beam" shields="reduce" neverMisses="true" woundsCrew="true" base="0.03">Never misses. Each shield layer cuts 1 damage and stays up. Burns crew it sweeps.</family>

  <!-- Genre-style weapons (built-in genre ships use these). Speeds follow the genre's cooldowns. -->
